readme.md

The Contact Management System is a Python-based application that allows users to manage personal or professional contacts efficiently. The program provides a simple command-line interface (CLI) for storing, viewing, searching, updating, and deleting contact information.

All contact records are stored in a JSON file, ensuring data persistence between program executions.

---

## Features

* Add new contacts
* View all saved contacts
* Search contacts by name
* Update existing contact details
* Delete contacts
* Store contact data in a JSON file
* User-friendly menu-driven interface
* Input validation for better reliability

